Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.77,0:00:04.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}欢迎收看《永恒》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Welcome to "Everlasting."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.07,0:00:07.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你接手了卡尔的活？是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got Carl's job? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.34,0:00:09.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别这样！恭喜你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop it! Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.61,0:00:12.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我真为你高兴。开工吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm very happy for you. Let's roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.21,0:00:15.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你为什么回来？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why'd you come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.35,0:00:16.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想见你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wanted to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.35,0:00:19.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不能。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.39,0:00:20.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.52,0:00:22.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我知道跟你开始会是什么下场。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause I know how things start with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.49,0:00:23.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛丽就是个该死的机器人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mary's a freakin' robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.62,0:00:25.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她还能有感觉，我挺惊讶的\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm surprised she can feel anything
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.59,0:00:27.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}吃了那么多情绪稳定剂。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with all the mood stabilizers she's on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.30,0:00:31.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她有躁郁症，还有家暴留下的创伤后应激障碍。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's bipolar and she has PTSD from the domestic abuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.34,0:00:40.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你夺走了我的一切。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have taken everything from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.64,0:00:41.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不会再这样了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.78,0:00:44.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}《永恒》……那是我的点子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Everlasting"... That was my idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.11,0:00:47.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要以欺诈罪起诉。什么？！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am suing for fraud. What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.78,0:00:53.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是我这辈子唯一做对的事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're the only thing in my life that I've ever done right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.39,0:00:57.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别这么煽情。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't get all sentimental.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.39,0:00:59.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我同意她最初的条件……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm agreeing to her original terms...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.66,0:01:03.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}永久持有《永恒》40%的股份。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}40% ownership of "Everlasting" in perpetuity.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.56,0:01:04.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这节目是你的点子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The show was your idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.64,0:01:09.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开工吧！走起！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's get to work! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.81,0:01:14.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 我最近好寂寞\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* I get so lonely lately
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.91,0:01:17.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 什么都激不起我的兴趣\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Nothing turns me on
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.58,0:01:19.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 射穿你内心的喧嚣\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Shoot the noise inside you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.71,0:01:22.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 卖掉鞋子换灵魂\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Sell your shoes for soul
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.45,0:01:24.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 射穿你身后的喧嚣\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Shoot the noise behind you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.35,0:01:26.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 市中心……哎哟！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Downtown... Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.29,0:01:27.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停下。停下！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.82,0:01:30.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}停下！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.36,0:01:33.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道我不喜欢那样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know I don't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.56,0:01:35.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}宝贝，我以为那样很性感。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Baby, I thought that it was hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.63,0:01:37.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，像人偶一样被甩来甩去？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, being thrown around like a mannequin?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.33,0:01:38.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去他的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Screw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.53,0:01:40.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}宝贝，对不起。我有点失控了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Babe, I'm sorry. I got a little carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.34,0:01:45.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这才是我，杰瑞米。就在这儿。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is me, Jeremy. Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.54,0:01:48.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是你脑子里那种色情戏码。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not some porn thing in your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.44,0:01:49.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是那样的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It wasn't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.74,0:01:53.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗，感觉就是那样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, well, it felt like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.69,0:02:06.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}* 射穿喧嚣，哥们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}* Shoot the noise, man
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.33,0:02:11.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只剩我们六个人了，玛丽凭什么得到家庭约会？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There are six of us left, and Mary gets the family date?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.73,0:02:14.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能把玛丽的资料调出来吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can we just pull up the Mary stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.34,0:02:15.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.57,0:02:16.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我太激动了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm so excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.97,0:02:19.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我能见到几周没见的女儿了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I get to see my little girl who I haven't seen in weeks,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.87,0:02:22.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她还能见到亚当。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and she gets to meet Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.28,0:02:24.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当看到莉莉·贝尔和我在一起，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When Adam sees Lily Belle and I together,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.71,0:02:27.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他就会知道我是个什么样的人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}he's gonna know what I'm truly about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.22,0:02:29.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这也太惨了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.85,0:02:30.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.88,0:02:32.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看她……老得不行了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, look at her... She's ancient.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.69,0:02:35.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}疲惫、愁苦、一身松垮……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tired, sad, saggy sack...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.96,0:02:37.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁想要那样的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who wants that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.36,0:02:39.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她比我还小一岁，混蛋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's a year younger than me, asshole.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.53,0:02:41.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎呀。抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oops. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.26,0:02:42.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得她很性感。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think she's really hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.53,0:02:44.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗？玛丽应该留在这比赛里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know? Mary should stay in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.00,0:02:46.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少会是个惊喜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At least it would be a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:50.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而不是又一个无聊老套的季度\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not another tired, ancient season
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.34,0:02:53.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}又是比基尼模特赢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}where a bikini model wins again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.37,0:02:55.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，如果玛丽能赢，那就太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, if Mary could win this, that would be amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.78,0:02:56.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那能彻底颠覆\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That could completely up-end
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.01,0:02:58.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}整个社会对年龄歧视的看法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the entire societal point of view on ageism.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.75,0:03:01.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不可能。知道为什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not gonna happen. You know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.52,0:03:06.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为男人能有那样的，谁还要那样的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because no guy wants that when he can have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.65,0:03:09.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}老太太这周就得走人，我保证。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Grandma's going home this week, guaranteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.59,0:03:10.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:12.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这世上没有一个男人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There's not one man in the universe
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.93,0:03:15.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会选一个坚强、聪明、\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who would pick a strong, intelligent,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.40,0:03:16.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}年纪稍大的女人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}slightly older woman
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.53,0:03:18.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而不要一个口音性感的花瓶？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}over a bimbo with a sexy accent?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.50,0:03:19.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:22.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，你错了。他完全可能选她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you're wrong. He absolutely could pick her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.27,0:03:23.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他没你想的那么肤浅。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's not as shallow as you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.94,0:03:26.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}绝对不可能。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Never gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.64,0:03:27.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.88,0:03:30.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那你就别光说不练，大男孩？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't you put your money where your mouth is, big boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.74,0:03:33.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赌50块，她能撑过这周。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}50 bucks says she lasts the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.55,0:03:35.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}赌就赌。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.68,0:03:37.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把钱看好了，小妞，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And stay close to your money, chica,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.78,0:03:40.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为悲伤的老妈子要完蛋了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'cause sad, old mama's going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.43,0:03:48.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，这样吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, you know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.76,0:03:50.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}从这一刻起，你来联合制作玛丽的约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}As of this minute, you are co-producing Mary's date.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:52.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道最终，是的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know that eventually, yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.03,0:03:53.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她会输给那个深喉女王，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}she is going to lose to the deep-throat queen,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.80,0:03:55.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但玛丽这周不会走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but Mary is not going home this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.57,0:03:57.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要我说了算就不会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not if I have anything to say about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.41,0:04:00.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦！这是女性力量。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh! That's girl power.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.34,0:04:04.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，你到底在干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, what the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.98,0:04:07.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Instagram？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Instagram?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.05,0:04:09.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}奎恩刚告诉我，你要联合制作玛丽家庭约会那一集。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Quinn just told me you're co-producing Mary's family date.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.58,0:04:10.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这到底是怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell is that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.85,0:04:12.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛丽现在归我。说好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mary is my girl now. That was the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.45,0:04:13.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，奎恩只是想让我确保\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, Quinn just wants me to make sure
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.72,0:04:14.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这场约会尽可能顺利。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the date goes as smoothly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.99,0:04:16.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么大不了的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's no big thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.76,0:04:18.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，跟你有关的事都是大事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, everything with you's a big thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.73,0:04:20.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说真的，我希望玛丽留在这比赛里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Seriously, I want Mary to stay in this competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.99,0:04:22.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得她对节目很有好处。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think she's really good for the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.83,0:04:24.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.33,0:04:26.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得奎恩为什么让我去约会现场？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why do you think Quinn wants me on the date?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.33,0:04:27.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们俩出问题了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you having problems?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.60,0:04:29.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这话什么意思？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.87,0:04:33.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没什么，好吗？没什么，我保证。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nothing, okay? Nothing. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.34,0:04:36.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我发誓，这事我站你这边。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I swear I'm on your side on this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.45,0:04:39.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.85,0:04:41.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开机。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.62,0:04:43.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开始。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And action.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.52,0:04:48.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这次家庭约会……对玛丽来说是难得的机会\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The family date... A unique opportunity for Mary
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.89,0:04:51.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把她最亲近的人介绍给亚当\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to introduce her nearest and dearest to Adam
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.09,0:04:54.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后他带她坐上超炫的直升机\N{\rEN\blur0.8}before he whisks her off on a stunning helicopter ride
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.50,0:04:58.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}飞越马林岬角，前往Saison餐厅共进晚餐。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}over the Marin headlands on their way to dinner at Saison.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.37,0:04:59.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.90,0:05:01.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，莉莉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Lil.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.10,0:05:02.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈妈！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.64,0:05:04.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈妈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.54,0:05:05.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.94,0:05:06.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.97,0:05:09.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁让夏娅说服我搞这个家庭约会的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Who let Shia talk me into this family playdate?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.91,0:05:11.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}唉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.08,0:05:13.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这简直是顶级扫兴，各位。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is a grade-A boner-killer, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.08,0:05:14.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}扫兴鬼！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Boner-killer!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.42,0:05:16.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}路易丝，见到你真好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Louise, it's so good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.62,0:05:19.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看这地方。我打赌你根本没想过我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at this place. I bet you didn't even miss us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.05,0:05:23.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我每分每秒都想你们。尤其是你，我的宝贝。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I miss you every minute. Especially you, my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.39,0:05:25.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我迫不及待想带你们参观\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I can't wait to show you around
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.56,0:05:27.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再介绍你们认识亚当。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and introduce you to Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.13,0:05:29.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他真帅。他真的认识女王吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He is so cute. Does he really know the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.76,0:05:32.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他太可爱了。是个真正的绅士。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, he is adorable. He's a real gentleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.93,0:05:34.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是货真价实的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's the real deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.64,0:05:36.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你们等着看我们今天安排了什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you guys, wait till you see what we have planned today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.80,0:05:39.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}超级棒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It is fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.07,0:05:40.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛丽，干杯。谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mary, cheers. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.44,0:05:42.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一切都还好吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, is everything okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.68,0:05:44.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好得不能再好了。看看我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, couldn't be happier. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.85,0:05:49.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是无酒精的，傻瓜。真家伙是给你的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Virgin, silly. The real ones are for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.75,0:05:51.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.08,0:05:52.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，我带你们好好参观。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, I'll give you the grand tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.69,0:05:53.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你先请。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.85,0:05:55.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，各位，小心脚下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, guys. Watch your step.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.69,0:05:57.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}飞行还顺利吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So how was the flight?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.62,0:05:59.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}头等舱。是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, first class. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.43,0:06:01.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哇。我们力求让客人满意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Wow. We aim to please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.09,0:06:02.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。早上不顺？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Bad morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:04.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事，都挺好。把那块砖头递给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nope. All good. Hand me that brick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.84,0:06:18.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我个人特别高兴玛丽拿到了这次家庭约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Personally, I am so glad that Mary got this family date.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.45,0:06:20.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她几乎没怎么跟他相处过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's had hardly any time with him at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.88,0:06:22.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她当单亲妈妈那么辛苦……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She works so hard as a single mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.72,0:06:23.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哎，你们，我不行了。我不行了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you guys, I can't. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.72,0:06:24.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是她应得的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She deserves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.02,0:06:27.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}家庭日。呸。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Family day. Pbht.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.59,0:06:29.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这简直是给屎抛光。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Talk about polishing a turd.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.72,0:06:31.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}卡。谢谢，很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Cut. Thanks, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.46,0:06:33.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去拍点空镜素材。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's go grab some B-roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:36.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，真烦人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Gosh, this is so annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.86,0:06:39.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}姑娘们，怎么样？感觉还好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ladies. How you doing? Feeling good?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.87,0:06:40.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.97,0:06:42.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还能有别的说法吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is there any other way?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:43.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我无聊到极点。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm bored out of my skull.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.94,0:06:45.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没手机，没网络。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No phone, no Internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.24,0:06:46.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们可是这屋里最聪明的两个姑娘。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're the two smartest girls in this house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.94,0:06:48.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也没啥好炫耀的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not saying much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.11,0:06:50.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们都沦落到数木匠工具带上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're down to talking about how many nails
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.18,0:06:51.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有多少颗钉子了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}are in the carpenter's tool belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.88,0:06:53.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我脑子都要变成浆糊了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my brain is turning into mush.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.68,0:06:54.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我太无聊了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am so bored,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.88,0:06:56.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}居然数睫毛解闷。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've been counting my eyelashes for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:06:59.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我都好几周没看新闻了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I haven't read the news in weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.62,0:07:01.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真惨。抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's a bummer. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.15,0:07:02.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天还有家庭约会，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, a-and today, family date,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.86,0:07:04.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}小孩子们到处乱跑？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}little kiddies running around?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.62,0:07:06.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着像《永恒街噩梦》。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sounds like "Nightmare on Everlasting Street."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.63,0:07:09.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说得……太对了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, you are so... right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.90,0:07:13.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这节目确实需要点新花样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This show could use a little something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.03,0:07:15.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}失陪一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Would you excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.90,0:07:17.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就是特别兴奋能到现场\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just so excited to get out there
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.84,0:07:19.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和我女儿在一起，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and be with my little girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.77,0:07:21.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把这小伙子介绍给我家人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and introduce this guy to my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.18,0:07:26.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我妹妹路易丝，她可是超级粉丝，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, Louise, my sister, she is such a fan,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.21,0:07:28.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她觉得自己早就认识你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}she feels like she already knows you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.08,0:07:29.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的吗？嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, really? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.78,0:07:31.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望都是好的一面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I hope just the good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.12,0:07:34.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊，拜托，夏娅。我讨厌这次约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, God, come on, Shia. I hate this date.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.26,0:07:37.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我觉得\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you know, I feel
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.66,0:07:39.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}家人是最重要的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}like family is the most important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.89,0:07:41.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.06,0:07:43.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没有他们的爱和支持，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, without their love and support,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.23,0:07:44.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还能有什么呢？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}what else is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.70,0:07:48.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，家人……我是说，那……是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, family's... I mean, that's... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.10,0:07:50.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那……对，很美好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's, yeah, delightful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.14,0:07:51.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我去准备一下，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, I'm gonna go get ready,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.57,0:07:53.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}待会儿现场见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I will see you out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.07,0:07:55.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。回头见，小鳄鱼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. See you later, alligator.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.84,0:08:00.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要输赌了。我要输了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm gonna lose the bet. I'm gonna lose the bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.31,0:08:01.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}杰，我需要一只兔子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jay. I need a bunny.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.58,0:08:03.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不是花花公子兔女郎，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, not a playboy bunny,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.22,0:08:06.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是红眼睛、垂耳朵的兔子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}a rabbit with red eyes and floppy ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.12,0:08:07.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一定要萌到爆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just make sure it's freakin' adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.92,0:08:11.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是不是太可口了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Isn't he just delicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:13.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.69,0:08:15.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，这不错。这不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, this is good. This is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.16,0:08:16.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个我能用。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.76,0:08:19.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希亚，不管你是怎么把她弄醒的，起作用了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Shia, whatever you did to wake her up, it's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.57,0:08:27.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让亚当见我女儿、我妹妹这件事……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The whole idea of Adam meeting my daughter, my sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.24,0:08:29.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她们得了解他，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}well, they need to know him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.14,0:08:31.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她们得知道他是个好男人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They need to know that he's a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.34,0:08:35.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那正是……那正是我前夫的问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was... That was the problem with my ex-husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.95,0:08:40.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他假装是个好男人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He pretended to be a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.12,0:08:45.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他假装是个有爱的男人，但他其实是个……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He pretended to be a loving man, but he was a...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.36,0:08:51.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他就是个自恋的……噩梦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He was just a narcissistic... nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.26,0:08:54.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}总之……亚当不是这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anyway... not Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.87,0:08:57.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他不是那种人。他不是。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's not like that. He's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.60,0:09:00.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当和我之间真的很特别。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam and I have something really special together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.97,0:09:02.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.88,0:09:06.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还坐直升机去吃晚餐？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And a helicopter to dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.18,0:09:12.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谁知道会发生什么，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, who knows what could happen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.28,0:09:15.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许我跟她谈的那几句还真起作用了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe my little talk with her worked after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.39,0:09:18.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，太好了，玛丽。太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, that's great, Mary. Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.06,0:09:19.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.63,0:09:20.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，目前……目前这些就够了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, that's... that's all we need for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.99,0:09:22.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你去拍点家庭日常素材吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why don't you go grab some family B-roll?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.29,0:09:25.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没问题。姑娘，你太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got it. You, girl, are killing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.63,0:09:26.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.93,0:09:28.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}开什么玩笑？今天结束前，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are you kidding me? By the end of the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.77,0:09:31.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当就会任你摆布。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam is gonna be wrapped around your little finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.04,0:09:32.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就继续保持现在的做法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You just keep doing what you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.94,0:09:34.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为你就是明星。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause you're a star.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.31,0:09:36.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.21,0:09:37.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.31,0:09:42.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，我得告诉你，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I got to tell you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.05,0:09:46.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我医生告诉我千万别把这个和这个混着喝，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}my doctor told me never to mix this with this,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.19,0:09:49.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我感觉棒极了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I feel amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.26,0:09:50.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.92,0:09:52.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我什么都能做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.99,0:09:56.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.40,0:10:07.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，莉莉！妈妈！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Lil! Mommy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.27,0:10:09.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，你能快进跳过那段吗\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, can you fast-forward through that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.28,0:10:11.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后帮我切到玛丽那边之类的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and just maybe get me into Mary or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.68,0:10:13.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想要什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.71,0:10:14.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今天要向电视台提案。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, the network pitch is today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.85,0:10:16.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我要确保你参与其中。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to make sure you're on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.75,0:10:20.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我参与。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:23.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.02,0:10:26.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就说说看……合伙人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's hear it... partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.83,0:10:28.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有很多好点子，切特，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have a lot of great ideas, Chet,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.00,0:10:30.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}全都在那里面。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and they're all right in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.90,0:10:34.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就说吧。开始提案。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, let's hear it. Start pitching.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.33,0:10:35.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在是股东了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm a part owner now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.80,0:10:37.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想亲自向电视台提案。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I want to pitch to the network myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.24,0:10:39.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你什么都不想先跟我说一声？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't want to run anything by me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.07,0:10:41.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不太想。好吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Not really. Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.95,0:10:47.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}左手，蓝色。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Left hand, blue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.05,0:10:48.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.08,0:10:49.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，哦，哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, oh, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.32,0:10:54.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天哪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.09,0:10:56.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很多年没这么玩过了。我知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I haven't done that in so many years. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.49,0:10:57.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再来一杯含羞草？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Another mimosa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.96,0:10:59.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，那我就不客气了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, don't mind if I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.23,0:11:01.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，不行，她在喝无酒精的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, no, she's doing virgins.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.19,0:11:02.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。也不能怪她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. Can't say I blame her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.43,0:11:05.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我喜欢看他们玩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love watching them play.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.46,0:11:08.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我个人喜欢端杯酒坐着\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Personally, I love sitting back with a drink
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.34,0:11:10.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让别人看着他们玩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}while someone else watches them play.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.94,0:11:13.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，大家休息十分钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, everybody, take 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.47,0:11:17.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我讨厌小孩……他们红扑扑的脸蛋和绝望的眼神。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hate children... their rosy cheeks and their desperate eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.78,0:11:19.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.05,0:11:22.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}浪漫戏我没问题，但，呃，小孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Romance I'm fine with, but, ugh, children.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.18,0:11:23.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，浪漫戏在后面，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Listen, romance is later,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.35,0:11:24.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你先熬过小孩这部分，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you just get through the kid part,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.48,0:11:26.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后我们会让你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then we will get you
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.09,0:11:28.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去参加你的浪漫烛光晚餐约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}on one of your little romantic candlelight dinner dates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.36,0:11:30.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看，在英国，成年人不用应付小孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}See, in England, adults don't have to deal with children.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.92,0:11:32.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我们才发明了保姆。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's why we invented the nanny.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.32,0:11:33.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我都没跟我奶奶完整聊过天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't have a full conversation
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.96,0:11:35.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直到我进入青春期。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}with my Gran until I hit puberty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.26,0:11:36.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我下楼吃晚饭时，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd come down for supper,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.76,0:11:39.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她总是轻蔑地看着我，一句话不说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}she'd look down her nose at me, not a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.83,0:11:42.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她就认定我没什么有意思的话可说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She just assumed I didn't have anything interesting to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.17,0:11:43.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗？嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you know what? Mm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.77,0:11:45.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她说得对。听着，我完全赞同。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She was right. Listen, you're preaching to the choir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.17,0:11:47.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我懂你。我也不喜欢小孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am with you. I don't like kids, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.27,0:11:49.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}前几天我在公园看见一个小孩在吃烟头。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I saw a kid the other day at the park eating a cigarette butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.98,0:11:51.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且他们很疯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And they're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.18,0:11:52.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗？他们整天拉屎。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what? They just poop all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.38,0:11:53.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们疯了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:54.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们就像野牛在吃草。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're like buffalo grazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.85,0:11:56.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，你要这么做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, this is what you're gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.25,0:11:58.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就蹲下来，跟他们平视，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're just gonna get down on their level, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.82,0:12:00.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后直视那孩子的眼睛……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you're gonna look the kid right in the eye...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.39,0:12:02.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别用居高临下的口气，他们不喜欢……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't talk down to them, they don't like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.32,0:12:04.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就做你自己。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you just be you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.26,0:12:06.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这样。嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's it. Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.86,0:12:10.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你会……我一点都不担心你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're g... I'm not even worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.53,0:12:12.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。谢谢。你会没事的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. Thanks. You're gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.53,0:12:15.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还在数睫毛吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You still counting your eyelashes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.40,0:12:18.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是只兔子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That is a rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.40,0:12:21.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，对。怎么样，博士？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, yeah. What's up, doc?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.17,0:12:22.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想抱抱他吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want to hold him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.51,0:12:24.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好啊，当然。给你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, sure. Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.14,0:12:25.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.48,0:12:26.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这真是，呃……这有点奇怪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is, um... This is strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.01,0:12:28.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗨。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.28,0:12:31.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，如果我提个主意，你觉得怎么样\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, what would you say if I proposed an idea
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.88,0:12:33.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能让你留在比赛里\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that would keep you in the competition
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.89,0:12:35.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还能增加你和亚当在一起的机会？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and increase your chances with Adam?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.89,0:12:40.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我会说，继续说。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'd say keep talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.43,0:12:42.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.13,0:12:44.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，把手给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, give me your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.16,0:12:46.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.03,0:12:47.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得在上头多撒点面粉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You have to put lots of flour on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.33,0:12:49.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.04,0:12:51.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.17,0:12:54.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这才有点样子了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now we're getting somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.58,0:12:57.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}挺简单的，对吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Simple enough, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.18,0:12:59.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你做得还不错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're not bad at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.88,0:13:01.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}继续揉这里。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Keep going here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.58,0:13:04.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}主要还是你在揉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're doing most of the kneading.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.25,0:13:05.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.45,0:13:08.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}莉莉，过来。这很好玩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lily, come here. This is fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.59,0:13:11.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你要来帮我们吗？给你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You gonna help us? Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.49,0:13:16.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}准备好了吗？给。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Ready? Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.26,0:13:17.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还记得吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.86,0:13:19.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后我们……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And then we...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.63,0:13:23.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}莉莉·贝尔，见到妈妈开心吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, Lily Belle, is it good seeing your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.47,0:13:25.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你好怪。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.14,0:13:26.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}莉莉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lily.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.47,0:13:31.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}唉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Aw.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.08,0:13:34.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，就是这样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, that is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.18,0:13:36.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛丽豁出去了，开始发力了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mary is bringing it. Steppin' up her game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.58,0:13:37.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不用谢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.49,0:13:42.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的钱呢，贱人？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got my money, bitch?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.96,0:13:44.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，我想我还是先拿着\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, I think I'll just hold onto it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.96,0:13:48.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}再拿个一两分钟。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for another minute or two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.57,0:13:56.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧？嗯，希望我们能想点办法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right? Well, we can do something about it, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.24,0:13:57.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们得加配料。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We need toppings.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.97,0:14:00.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，想见见我的朋友吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, do you want to meet my friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.51,0:14:02.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好可爱。是真的吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's so cute. Is it real?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.98,0:14:04.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.14,0:14:06.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈妈，我想要只兔子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mommy, I want a rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.65,0:14:09.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真抱歉打扰你们……你们的家庭约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm so sorry to interrupt, you guys... your family date.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.62,0:14:11.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我看到这个小家伙时，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But when I saw this little guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.38,0:14:14.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就知道孩子们肯定会喜欢摸它。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just knew that the kids would love to pet it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.12,0:14:15.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你真好心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, that's so sweet of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.36,0:14:18.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好心？这是我的时间。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Sweet? This is my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.96,0:14:20.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这、这是我的约会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-It's my date.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.53,0:14:25.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，呃，亲爱的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, uh, honey,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.13,0:14:28.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这里的人可能都瞎得像蝙蝠，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}everybody here might be blind as a bat,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.27,0:14:30.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可我有眼睛。听见了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I have eyes. Do you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.67,0:14:33.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且我看得见你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I can see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.71,0:14:38.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}妈妈。兔子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mommy. The rabbit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.08,0:14:40.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.25,0:14:42.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在归你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's yours now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.95,0:14:44.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}去玩吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Go play.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.42,0:14:46.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛丽，我不是想……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mary, I wasn't trying to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.15,0:14:49.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我和亚当的约会，我们处得特别好，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is my date with Adam, and we're getting along great,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.56,0:14:52.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比你们当初好多了，所以滚开吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}better than you ever did, so just get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.30,0:15:05.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你该扭着你那可爱的小律师屁股\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's time for you to wiggle your sweet little lawyer ass
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.30,0:15:06.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}离开这里了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.47,0:15:08.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，你的兔子时刻结束了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, you had your bunny moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.71,0:15:10.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}滚出去！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Get the hell out!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.71,0:15:15.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}猜字游戏？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Charades?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.08,0:15:16.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}脸部彩绘？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Face painting?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.18,0:15:20.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，每个男人想要的就是……一个疯婆子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, that's what every guy wants... a bunny boiler.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.22,0:15:23.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当绝不会留下她……绝不会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam's never gonna keep her... never.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.72,0:15:25.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别担心钱的事，奎因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't worry about the money, Quinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.22,0:15:26.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我信你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I trust you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.49,0:15:28.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}提案会上见。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll see you at the pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.20,0:15:33.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛丽到底怎么回事？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What the hell is going on with Mary?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.50,0:15:35.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她、她一直都这样吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}H-has she been like this the whole time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.50,0:15:37.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我知道刚才有点失控，但你知道，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I... I know that was a little crazy, but, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.77,0:15:40.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她看起来真的很开心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}she seems like she's having a really good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.34,0:15:41.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.34,0:15:44.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她什么时候又开始喝酒的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}When did she start drinking again?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.78,0:15:47.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，她没喝酒。没有，那些是无酒精的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, she's not drinking. No, those are virgins.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.21,0:15:49.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可不确定。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wouldn't be so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.12,0:15:52.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是她姐姐。我了解她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm her sister. I know her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.35,0:15:55.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，听着，我可以去问问她，但……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, well, look, I can check with her, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.22,0:15:56.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.49,0:16:00.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有，你能确认她有在吃药吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And can you make sure that she's taking her meds?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.39,0:16:02.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我、我担心她没吃。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I'm worried that she's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.40,0:16:04.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看起来就像……当然。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It just seems like... Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.10,0:16:08.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但你知道，她真的挺好的……甚至很开心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But, you know, she really has been fine... happy, even.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.54,0:16:12.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}躁郁症的人一停药就这样……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's the thing with bipolar people off their meds...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.50,0:16:15.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们特别有意思，直到……没意思了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They're really fun until... they're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.51,0:16:17.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}路易丝，别担心了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Louise, stop worrying.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.38,0:16:21.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，去吧，放松，好好玩。这里有我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, go, relax, have fun. We got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.05,0:16:23.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.52,0:16:30.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，我们得让玛丽重新占据上风。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, we've got to get Mary back up on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.06,0:16:31.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得把害虫这档子事翻篇。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're gonna put this vermin stuff behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.72,0:16:33.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，你想怎么做？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, what do you want to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.43,0:16:35.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她有个前夫，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's got an ex-husband, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.33,0:16:37.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他是个混蛋。对，他打过她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's a prick. Yeah, he hit her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.40,0:16:39.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}基本上可以说，他弄断了莉莉·贝尔的胳膊，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He basically, you know, broke Lily Belle's arm,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.40,0:16:40.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以我会说，还不止这些。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}so I would say "and then some."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.80,0:16:42.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道我们能怎么做吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know what we could do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.27,0:16:44.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们可以派个第二摄制组，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We could just send out a second unit,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.40,0:16:46.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拍点他道歉的备用镜头，或者……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}get some B-roll of him apologizing or...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.54,0:16:48.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，我都不知道他会做什么，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, I don't even know what he would be doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.21,0:16:50.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但这总能稍微推动一下吧，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but it's got to help move the needle a little bit, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.25,0:16:56.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}或者我们可以把他请来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Or we could bring him in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.28,0:16:59.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。不，不，不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.45,0:17:00.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托，拜托，拜托。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.79,0:17:02.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，每个……每个白衣骑士\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, every... Every white knight
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.42,0:17:05.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都需要他们的黑暗骑士，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}needs their dark knight, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.26,0:17:07.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。那感觉……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. That just feels...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.43,0:17:09.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，听着，我们把前夫请来，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, look, we bring in the ex-husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.13,0:17:13.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当就得站在玛丽这边对抗他，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and Adam has to take Mary's side against him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.17,0:17:18.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他扮演英雄，让他们重归于好，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He plays the hero, that brings them back together,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.20,0:17:19.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这对她来说很棒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}which is great for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.51,0:17:22.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，这可能帮玛丽\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, it could help Mary
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.84,0:17:25.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}得到一点了结吧，我想。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}get a little bit of closure, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.81,0:17:28.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，因为，你知道，我读到过这个……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, because, you know, I read about this...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.85,0:17:31.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有一种疗法，让你直面施虐者\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This thing where this therapy where confronting your abuser
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.58,0:17:32.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的能改变你的人生。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}actually changes your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.85,0:17:35.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对对。我们只是想帮忙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Right, right. And all we want to do is help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.53,0:17:39.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就这么办。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.59,0:17:40.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.73,0:17:43.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得去参加电视台的提案会，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I've got to go to a network pitch,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.63,0:17:45.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但需要我的话，发短信给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but if you need me, text me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.60,0:17:47.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，我来办。我来办。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, I'm on it. I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.67,0:17:54.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不是故意要打乱什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't mean to disrupt anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.64,0:17:57.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是……我以为孩子们\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just... I thought that the kids
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.21,0:17:59.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会想看看兔子。仅此而已。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}would like to see the rabbit. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.15,0:18:03.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，谁知道玛丽会那样反应。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, who knew that Mary would react that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.48,0:18:06.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那……那挺吓人的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was... That was scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.15,0:18:08.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。其实反应挺大的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm. It was a lot, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.92,0:18:10.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样可以吗？你要的就这些？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that good? Is that all you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:12.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很完美。好的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was perfect. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.53,0:18:14.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，各位，收拾东西。我们走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, everybody, pack it up. We're moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.76,0:18:17.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“谁知道玛丽会那样反应？”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Who knew Mary would react that way?"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.17,0:18:22.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你完全知道她会怎么做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You knew exactly what she was gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.64,0:18:26.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.94,0:18:28.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那……那太蠢了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was... That was stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.81,0:18:30.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那……甚至有点恶毒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was... It was mean, even.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.81,0:18:32.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不知道。就像……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't know. It's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.54,0:18:35.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我发现自己做越来越蠢的事\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm finding myself doing dumber and dumber things
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.68,0:18:36.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是为了引起你的注意，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}just to try to get your attention,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.95,0:18:38.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太荒唐了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and it's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.32,0:18:40.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这不是我。真的不是。对不起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's not me. It's not. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.55,0:18:43.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你现在就引起了我的注意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got my attention right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.36,0:18:45.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.39,0:18:47.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.73,0:18:51.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们在亚特兰大是不是有点什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did we have something in Atlanta?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.33,0:18:53.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我真的觉得有，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause I really felt like we did,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.83,0:18:56.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这也是我回来的唯一原因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and it's the only reason that I came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.84,0:18:58.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但从那以后，我是说，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But since then, I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.34,0:19:00.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们连一次独处的机会都没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we haven't even had one moment alone together.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.71,0:19:03.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我又来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'm doing it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.68,0:19:05.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这地方，就像，把我变成\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This place, it's, like, it's turning me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.44,0:19:07.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那种极度没有安全感的女人……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}into one of those women who's just so insecure and...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.98,0:19:11.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，我也感觉到了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look, I felt it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.62,0:19:15.69,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我吃完晚饭回来，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Um, when I get back from dinner,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.72,0:19:16.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能来这儿见我吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}can you meet me here?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.49,0:19:21.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道个地方。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know a spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.23,0:19:24.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我知道怎么避开监控摄像头了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think I figured out how to beat the security cams.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.83,0:19:29.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，就这么定了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, it's a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.34,0:19:31.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太好了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.01,0:19:37.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你做了什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You did what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.01,0:19:39.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我刚给那人打了电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just called the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.58,0:19:41.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}邀请他来上节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And invited him onto the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.35,0:19:42.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}做个采访。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For an interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.52,0:19:44.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这家伙让玛丽的生活变成人间地狱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This guy made Mary's life a living hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.52,0:19:45.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他虐待了她好多年。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He abused her for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.85,0:19:47.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这正是我们请他上节目的原因。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Which is exactly why we're bringing him on the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.89,0:19:49.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，看看她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.56,0:19:51.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她显然被那家伙对她做的事困住了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's obviously stuck on whatever that guy did to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.79,0:19:54.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们在帮玛丽。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We're doing Mary a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.26,0:19:55.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，那全是鬼话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, that's a load of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.70,0:19:57.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在做你一贯做的事，就是做出好节目。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You are doing what you always do, which is make good TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.86,0:20:00.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，嘿，我说的是真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, hey, I'm telling you the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.53,0:20:02.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，那会超级有力量\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, it's going to be crazy empowering
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.37,0:20:04.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看着玛丽当面对质这家伙。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to watch Mary confront this guy to his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.40,0:20:06.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和施虐者对话，是很大的一步。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Speaking to your abuser, it is a huge step.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.94,0:20:08.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那会很棒\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's gonna be amazing
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.38,0:20:09.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对那百万其他女人来说\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for the million of other women out there
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.94,0:20:12.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那些任由丈夫欺负自己的女人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}who are letting their husbands knock them around.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.38,0:20:14.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以，这是一场圣战？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, this is a crusade?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.41,0:20:16.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只是玛丽还不知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mary just doesn't know it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.58,0:20:18.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，瑞秋，呃，他来了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Rachel, uh, he's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.69,0:20:28.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}柯克，你好。我是瑞秋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kirk, hi. Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.46,0:20:30.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿。你好。很高兴见到你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey. Hi. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.06,0:20:31.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是想确保你知道\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just want to make sure that you know
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.53,0:20:32.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}摄像机全程都会开着\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that there will be cameras running
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.66,0:20:34.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在这儿的时候。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}the whole time you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.03,0:20:35.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}同意书上是这么说的。好的，没问题。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what the release said. Okay, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.54,0:20:36.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只想和她谈谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just want to talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.80,0:20:38.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是我几个月来唯一想要的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's all I've wanted for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.40,0:20:39.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是你的机会，你知道，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And this is your opportunity to do that, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.57,0:20:40.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真正告诉玛丽你的感受。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}really tell Mary how you feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.81,0:20:42.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我可以照着纸念吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is it okay if I read off paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.54,0:20:44.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我写了些东西。可以，柯克，随便。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I wrote some things down. Yeah, Kirk, literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.54,0:20:46.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你想怎么做都行，但，你知道，我个人觉得，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Anything you want to do, but, you know, I mean, personally,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.41,0:20:47.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得会更好\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think it would be better
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.58,0:20:49.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果你发自内心地跟她说，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}if you just spoke to her from the heart,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.05,0:20:50.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而不是照着念。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}you know, rather than reading it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.48,0:20:52.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对。好主意。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah. That's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.42,0:20:54.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}对，这是得到了结的绝佳机会，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, this is a really great chance to get some closure,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.32,0:20:56.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让你们俩重归于好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}make things right between the two of you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.09,0:20:58.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们三个人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.36,0:20:59.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}莉莉·贝尔。哦，对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lily Belle. Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.56,0:21:01.39,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那是她两岁生日派对时拍的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's at her second birthday party.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.43,0:21:02.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}天啊。这小表情。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God. What a face.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.56,0:21:03.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她是不是很漂亮？这小表情。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Isn't she beautiful? What a face.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.86,0:21:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是啊，她一出现整个房间都亮了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah, she can light up a room. Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.83,0:21:09.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗，离开她……真的很难熬。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, it's... it's been hard being away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.74,0:21:14.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像……我的一部分被掏空了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's like, uh... It's like a piece of me is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.57,0:21:16.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这么神神秘秘的是干什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's up with all the secrecy?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.54,0:21:18.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太让人兴奋了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is so exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.88,0:21:20.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}直升机会降落在草坪上\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is the helicopter gonna land on the lawn
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.88,0:21:21.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后带我们去吃晚餐吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and take us to dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.98,0:21:23.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是这样吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is that what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.12,0:21:24.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个我不能告诉你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I can't tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.75,0:21:25.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.88,0:21:28.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们要在海滩上骑马吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Are we gonna ride horses on the beach?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.36,0:21:31.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那句话怎么说来着，呃……哦对，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's that phrase, um... it's, uh... oh, right,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.86,0:21:34.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“被狠狠骑过，湿着就丢一边。”\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"rode hard and put away wet."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.13,0:21:36.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.93,0:21:39.33,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是太兴奋了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm just really excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.37,0:21:40.70,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛丽。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.03,0:21:44.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你怎么会在这里？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.67,0:21:46.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只想谈谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just want to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.47,0:21:48.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不能来这里。天啊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You can't be here. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.88,0:21:50.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没……我没看过这个节目，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I haven't... I haven't seen the show,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.04,0:21:51.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}任何……这些我都没看过。你必须离开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}any... any of this. You have to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.68,0:21:53.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是听说你一直在谈我们的事，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just, I've heard that you've been talking about us,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.61,0:21:55.35,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谈我们过去的生活。求你别毁了我这次机会，柯克。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}about the life that we had. Please don't ruin this for me, Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.38,0:21:56.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我听说你一直在抹黑我\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hear you've been dragging my name through the mud
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.88,0:21:58.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还在电视上讲我的事。你得离开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and telling stories about me on TV. You need to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.62,0:21:59.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你得……来人，请他离开。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You need to... Someone, please make him leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.95,0:22:01.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只是想说出我这边的说法。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I just want to tell my side of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.62,0:22:03.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}拜托。我不想听你说什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Please. I don't care what you have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.52,0:22:05.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你来这里干什么？！你怎么来的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you doing here?! How did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.76,0:22:08.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他们说你知情，也同意我来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}They told me that you knew, that you were okay that you knew I was coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.06,0:22:09.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}制作人说你知情。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The producers said you knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.56,0:22:10.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好，叫亚当出来。什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, send out Adam. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.90,0:22:16.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛丽，你没事吧？呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mary, you all right? Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.04,0:22:17.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就是他吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is him, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.47,0:22:19.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就是那个英国废物吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This is the English piece of crap, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.64,0:22:20.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我没同意跟他谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I didn't agree to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.91,0:22:22.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，等等，老兄。闭嘴，老兄！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, hold on, mate. Shut up, mate!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.81,0:22:24.98,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是来跟我妻子谈谈的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm here to talk to my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.01,0:22:26.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}听着，现在不是时候，所以我们不如就……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, look, now's not the time, so why don't we ju...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.81,0:22:28.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}行了。退后。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right. Back off.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.55,0:22:29.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在正是时候，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now is exactly the time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.92,0:22:31.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我六个月来一直想跟你谈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have been trying for six months to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.98,0:22:33.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你从不回家，也从不接电话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're never home, you never answer your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.65,0:22:35.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果我得上这个破节目才能跟你说话，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If I have to come on this damn show to talk to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.79,0:22:37.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那我就这么做！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}then that's exactly what I'm gonna do!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.66,0:22:38.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爸爸？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Daddy?
