Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.55,0:23:04.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}玛丽，我的孩子到底为什么会上这个节目？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mary, what the hell is my kid doing on this show?
