Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.10,0:23:23.67,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说不定我们最后会在一起。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, maybe we end up together.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.70,0:23:25.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你这个满脑子妄想的疯婆子，知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're a delusional hag, you know that?
