Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.89,0:27:36.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我猜猜，本来应该是\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, let me guess, it was supposed to be
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.76,0:27:37.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“对抗混蛋的时刻”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"a stand up to the bastard moment."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.99,0:27:39.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你是想走这个方向吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's what you were going for?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.32,0:27:41.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看起来很棒。这非常重要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You came off looking great. That's very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.89,0:27:43.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你大概以为我救了她全家，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, well, you'd think I saved her family
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.76,0:27:45.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}免遭俄国哥萨克人的劫掠。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}from being pillaged by Russian Cossacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.40,0:27:48.87,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Kirk、哥萨克人……反正都一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Kirk, Cossacks... It's the same difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.90,0:27:51.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但听着，从现在开始对你很容易。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But, listen, it's very easy for you from here on out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.04,0:27:52.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你只要\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, all you have to do
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.27,0:27:54.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}坐直升机，浪漫晚餐约会，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}is a helicopter ride, a romantic dinner date,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.94,0:27:56.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还有，呃，在海滩上亲热，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and some, uh, making out on the beach,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.44,0:27:59.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这个我知道你肯定没问题，所以……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}which I know that you'll ace, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.08,0:28:00.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}经历了这么多折腾之后，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}After all that rigmarole,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.75,0:28:02.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在必须留下她了，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have to keep her now, don't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.88,0:28:05.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯哼，除非你想让全国人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm-hmm, unless you want the entire country
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.05,0:28:06.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}都觉得你是个混蛋。我就知道。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to think you're a dick. Thought so.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.99,0:28:09.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她就是，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's just, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.46,0:28:12.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她太强势了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She's intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.49,0:28:14.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}可怜的Adam，抱歉你的工作\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Poor Adam, I'm sorry your job
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.76,0:28:16.93,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不全是口交和泳池派对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}isn't all BJs and pool parties.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.96,0:28:18.26,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，晚上还长着呢。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, the evening's young yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.00,0:28:22.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}有喜欢的人了吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You liking anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.00,0:28:25.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}除了Grace。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Besides Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.50,0:28:29.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.42,0:28:40.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}在豪宅里度过的这场家庭约会真是多事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And what an eventful family date it's been here at the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.09,0:28:43.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在，在Adam和Mary准备\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Now, before Adam and Mary take a moment to prepare
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.16,0:28:45.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚浪漫独处之前，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for tonight's romantic tet-à-tet,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.46,0:28:48.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们有机会和他们聊聊。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}we were given the opportunity to catch up with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.56,0:28:49.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Adam。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.56,0:28:55.03,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是的，呃……说实话，Mary，在今天之前，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes, um... honestly, Mary, before today began,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.07,0:28:57.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我完全不知道我们之间的关系\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I had no idea what a relationship between us
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.44,0:28:59.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}会是什么样子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}would look like.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.27,0:29:01.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有孩子，有家庭。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, you have a child, family.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.51,0:29:04.31,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我只有一间空办公室和伦敦一间冷冰冰的出租屋。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have an empty office and a cold bed-sit in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.34,0:29:07.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但今天和你度过这一天后，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But after spending the day with you today,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.41,0:29:09.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亲眼看到\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and seeing first-hand
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.25,0:29:12.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不得不……和Kirk经历的一切……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}what you've had to... go through with Kirk...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.88,0:29:14.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我对你有了新的敬意，Mary。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have a new respect for you, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.92,0:29:18.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也重新理解了当单亲妈妈意味着什么。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And a new respect for what it means to be a single mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.03,0:29:21.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他真会说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.33,0:29:22.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不常这样做，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't do this very often,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.86,0:29:25.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但不知道你愿不愿意收下这把我特制的钥匙，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I wonder if you wouldn't accept this special key
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.46,0:29:27.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就在下一场仪式之前？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}in advance of the next ceremony?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.47,0:29:29.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这样你就能放松，知道你很安全，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So you can relax and know that you are safe
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.24,0:29:30.97,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}能进入下一轮比赛。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}through to the next round of competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.00,0:29:35.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，玛丽，你愿意收下这把永恒之钥吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So, Mary, will you accept this Everlasting key?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.28,0:29:40.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}愿意。当然愿意，亚当。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yes. Yes, Adam, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.18,0:29:41.51,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}很好。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.55,0:29:44.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这就对了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.12,0:29:46.38,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.42,0:29:48.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.92,0:29:52.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.63,0:29:58.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我得说，这一点毋庸置疑。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I got to say, you can take that to the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.10,0:30:06.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我知道他对我有感觉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I know he feels something for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.14,0:30:10.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我吻他的时候能感觉到。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I could sense it when I kissed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.18,0:30:15.15,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}莉莉贝尔是不是特别漂亮？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Isn't Lily Belle just beautiful, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.18,0:30:17.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}希望她会喜欢英国。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I hope that she likes it in the U.K.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.58,0:30:20.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那天气，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The weather, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.92,0:30:23.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为我老是想象\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Because I-I just keep envisioning
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.19,0:30:26.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那个卖火柴的小女孩冻在门口。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}th-that Little Match Girl freezing in the doorway.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.12,0:30:28.46,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.49,0:30:32.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至于柯克……他这下是彻底笑不出来了，肯定的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And Kirk... he's really had his last laugh, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.46,0:30:37.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他以为他能就这么闯进来对我指手画脚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He thinks that he can just walk in here and tell me what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.47,0:30:39.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没人能对我指手画脚，对吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No one can tell me what to do, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.44,0:30:42.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的人生是我自己的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}My life is my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.94,0:30:46.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}亚当给你那把钥匙时，你是什么感觉？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, how did it feel when Adam gave you that key?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.08,0:30:47.91,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那……那感觉挺特别的，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That... that was pretty special, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.95,0:30:49.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，亚当。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, Adam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.32,0:30:53.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且他……他会在英国照顾我们。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And he... he is gonna take care of us in England.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.35,0:30:56.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你知道，我不是说钱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You know, I don't mean, you know, money.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.39,0:31:00.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我是说，他会保护莉莉贝尔，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I mean, like, he'll protect Lily Belle,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.33,0:31:03.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}然后她会带点英国口音，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and then she'll have a little English accent,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.10,0:31:06.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我就可以一直拿这个逗她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I'll be able to tease her about it all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.10,0:31:08.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你今晚感觉怎么样？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But how are you feeling about tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.57,0:31:10.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}和亚当的约会？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}The date, with Adam?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.30,0:31:13.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.47,0:31:17.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}今晚……很特别。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Tonight is... special.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.71,0:31:22.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}其实我该去换衣服了，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I should change, actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.25,0:31:26.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我得先……做点事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}but I have to... do something first.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.12,0:31:28.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}抱歉。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.52,0:31:32.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就……等一下。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just... one moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.32,0:31:36.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。我们，呃……先待命。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Let's just, uh... Let's stand by.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.66,0:31:38.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What's wrong with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.10,0:31:40.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃，我猜她只是紧张。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh, she's just nervous, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.03,0:31:41.23,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}柯克那档子事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That stuff with Kirk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.27,0:31:42.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你觉得？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.63,0:31:45.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为看起来不只是紧张那么简单。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}'Cause it seems a little bit more than just nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.04,0:31:50.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}呃……你知道，她当然会难过。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Uh... well, you know, of course she's upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.14,0:31:52.34,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你用她前夫来搞她。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You sabotaged her with her ex-husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.38,0:31:54.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你让亚当去打了一架。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You set Adam up for a fistfight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.05,0:31:56.25,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说不定就是你让莉莉进去\N{\rEN\blur0.8}For all I know, you sent Lily in there
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.28,0:31:57.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把柯克逼疯的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}to push Kirk over the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.55,0:31:59.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她要是崩溃了，都是你的错。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If she is losing it, it's your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.50,0:32:10.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他在里面吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is he in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.53,0:32:11.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等警察来就带走。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Only till the police get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.00,0:32:13.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我觉得你不该进去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't think you should go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.33,0:32:15.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他被绑着，对吧？对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He's restrained, right? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.53,0:32:17.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}没事。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.17,0:32:19.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我需要你的时候会喊你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You'll know if I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.31,0:32:28.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真可悲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.45,0:32:31.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，来了，正好赶上演讲。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, here we go, just in time for the speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.52,0:32:33.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}等不及要听了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can't wait to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.03,0:32:41.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}下地狱吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Burn in Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.03,0:32:46.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不需要你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't need you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.10,0:32:51.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有男人了，一个真正的男人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have a man, a real man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.27,0:32:54.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你看到亚当为我做了什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Did you see what Adam did for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.41,0:32:55.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}他爱我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}He loves me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.67,0:32:59.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}比你爱得深多了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}More than you ever could.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.22,0:33:04.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.75,0:33:07.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看看你，高高在上的样子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Look at you, up on your high horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.15,0:33:09.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你演得真好，玛丽，这点我承认。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You play it well, Mary, I'll give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.46,0:33:10.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真是个演技派。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're quite the actress.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.82,0:33:14.49,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你把那些好莱坞的人都骗过去了，是吧？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You got all these Hollywood people fooled, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.53,0:33:15.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但我了解你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.63,0:33:19.53,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能有我是你的福气，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You were lucky to have me,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.56,0:33:21.47,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}因为还有谁会爱你？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}because who else is gonna love you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.50,0:33:24.17,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}爱我？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.20,0:33:25.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你打我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.44,0:33:27.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我打你的时候你说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And what did you say when I hit you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.71,0:33:31.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我让你住手。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I asked you to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.21,0:33:34.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，你没有。那是演员在说话。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you didn't. That's the actress talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.48,0:33:38.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你说的是“对不起”。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You said, "I'm sorry."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.75,0:33:44.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，我没有。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.09,0:33:45.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我爱你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.86,0:33:49.30,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}但是，你……是你把我这一面逼出来的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}But, you... you brought this out in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.33,0:33:51.43,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是你逼我这么做的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You make me do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.46,0:33:52.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你就是想要。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You want it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.43,0:33:56.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}说实话吧，玛丽。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Be honest, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.64,0:33:59.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}这是从哪来的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where does this come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.77,0:34:03.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你内心的黑暗，这种渴望？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}This darkness inside you, this wanting it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.31,0:34:04.74,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你疯了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You're insane.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.78,0:34:06.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，疯的人是你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, you're the one who's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.74,0:34:10.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你还会把这病传给莉莉贝尔。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you're gonna give this sickness to Lily Belle.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.85,0:34:14.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她倒不如没有妈妈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She'd be better off with no mother at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.79,0:34:16.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她跟着陌生人长大都比这强。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}She'd be better off growing up with strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.86,0:34:18.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.32,0:34:22.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}至少那样她还有机会。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}At least then, she'd have a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.53,0:34:34.21,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那么，为了迎接即将到来的浪漫之夜，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And so, in preparation for the romantic evening to come,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.24,0:34:37.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们的家庭约会到此结束。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}our family date has come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.51,0:34:45.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。你真是个幸运的女孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh. You are just such a lucky girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.68,0:34:47.75,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.79,0:34:51.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}那就是我……幸运女孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That's me... lucky girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.16,0:34:57.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}莉莉贝尔……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Lily Belle...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.83,0:35:04.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}记住妈妈爱你\N{\rEN\blur0.8}just remember mama loves you
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.30,0:35:08.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}胜过这世上的一切。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}more than anything else in this entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.81,0:35:11.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我也爱你，妈妈。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I love you, too, mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.55,0:35:17.65,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，Lil，走吧。该走了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, Lil, come on. It's time to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.52,0:35:21.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.96,0:35:27.79,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，走吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All right, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.83,0:35:32.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我……我今天真开心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I... I'm so glad for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.84,0:35:39.14,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谢谢你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.84,0:35:44.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}That was awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.48,0:35:47.55,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就像以前一样……完全是瓦肯心灵融合。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It was like the old days... Total Vulcan mind meld.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.58,0:35:49.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}“胸器和克鲁尼”……成交！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}"Boobs and Clooney"... Sold!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.25,0:35:50.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}-因为你很棒。  -不，你才棒。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}-Because you're amazing.   -No, you're amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.98,0:35:53.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，你和我在一起，这才对。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, you and me together, that's the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.22,0:35:58.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.56,0:36:01.19,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们就在这做。就在这儿做。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Let's do it here. Let's do it right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.23,0:36:02.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}为什么，为什么，为什么，为什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Why, why, why, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.39,0:36:03.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}来吧，我们有一整栋豪宅。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on, we got the whole mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.59,0:36:04.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好。来吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.60,0:36:07.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.67,0:36:10.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}怎么了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.34,0:36:15.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，Cynthia。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Cynthia.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.67,0:36:17.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嗯。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.31,0:36:20.85,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}真的吗？你听到心跳了，嗯？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No kidding? You heard the heartbeat, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.75,0:36:28.29,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不。呃……不，太棒了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No. Uh... no, that's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.36,0:36:33.99,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}男孩？男孩。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}A boy? A boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.02,0:36:36.63,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，呃……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.50,0:36:40.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你有没有觉得我们进展太快了？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do you ever think we're moving too fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.43,0:36:41.73,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.77,0:36:45.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}也许我们该推迟婚礼。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Maybe we should postpone the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.54,0:36:48.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}是因为今天早上的事吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is this about this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.27,0:36:49.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我的天。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.57,0:36:52.61,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你难道没意识到你做了什么吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't you realize what you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.64,0:36:54.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你跳下去救了她？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}How you jumped in to save her?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.61,0:36:56.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}所以是因为Rachel？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}So this is about Rachel?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.95,0:36:59.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不……也许吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No... maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.65,0:37:02.62,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}看来你喜欢难追的，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It seems like you like hard-to-get,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.65,0:37:04.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而我让你太容易得手了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}and I've made it pretty easy for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.79,0:37:06.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你在说什么？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.06,0:37:11.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}如果剩下的素材也能证实这一点，\N{\rEN\blur0.8}If the rest of the footage backs that up,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.93,0:37:13.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想我可能爱上你了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I think I might be in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.86,0:37:16.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}确实能证实，而且Chet欠你50块。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Well, it does, and Chet owes you 50 bucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.03,0:37:17.37,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}恭喜。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.80,0:37:20.27,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我以为你会更开心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I thought you'd be happier.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.31,0:37:21.77,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我很开心。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.57,0:37:27.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我都不知道。嘿，呃，出事了。是Mary。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't even know. Hey, um, something's wrong. It's Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.08,0:37:28.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她在哪？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.08,0:37:29.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不知怎么她上了屋顶。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Somehow she got on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.52,0:37:31.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}什么？呃，快去，快去。快去快去快去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}What? Uh, go, go. Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.48,0:37:33.42,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我报警。快去。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I'll call the police. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.40,0:37:50.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}嘿，Mary。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Hey, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.67,0:37:55.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}别过来。我说真的，Rachel。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Don't. I'm serious, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.08,0:38:02.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们能谈谈吗，就一会儿？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can we talk, just a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.45,0:38:03.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}谈谈？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.78,0:38:08.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吧，我知道上次不算什么，但这次我是认真的。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, I know it was nothing last time, but I am serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.09,0:38:09.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我们这边出状况了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}We have a situation here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.69,0:38:10.89,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦，一群白痴。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh, idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.92,0:38:13.82,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我非得给警长口交才能叫辆车过来吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Do I have to blow the sergeant just to get a car out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.86,0:38:15.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}让我第一个认输吧。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Allow me to be the first to admit defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.99,0:38:18.06,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Mary还在上面，输的人付钱。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mary's still in, loser pays.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.10,0:38:19.66,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我想公开声明\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I'd like to go on record saying
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.70,0:38:21.57,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}世界上有无数性感、\N{\rEN\blur0.8}that there are any number of hot,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.60,0:38:23.10,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}火辣的四十岁左右女人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}sexy 40-ish women in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.13,0:38:24.94,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好了，你觉得我在乎赌局吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, do you think I care about a bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.97,0:38:28.54,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我有个女孩在屋顶上，却没摄像机，行吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I have a girl on the roof and no camera, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.57,0:38:30.07,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我现在需要有人盯着屋顶。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I need eyes on the roof now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.11,0:38:31.81,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}废话，谁去？你知道吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No kidding, who? You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.84,0:38:34.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你能不能别挡着我，让我做你的节目？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Can you just get out of my way while I produce your show?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.08,0:38:35.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快说。谁？是谁？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come on. Who? Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.61,0:38:37.01,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Jeremy，你到底在哪？Mary。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Jeremy, where the hell are you? Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.45,0:38:42.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我不想再有这种感觉了。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I don't want to feel this way anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.49,0:38:46.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}而且我……我也不想伤害我的孩子。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And I... And I don't want to hurt my baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.59,0:38:48.09,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不必这样，Mary。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}And you don't have to, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.13,0:38:50.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你真的不必。我们可以帮你。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You really don't have to. We can get you help.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.60,0:38:52.83,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我、我不知道我是……我是好人\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I-I-I don't know if I'm... if I'm good
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.86,0:38:57.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}还是我……我是个怪物。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}or if I... if I'm a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.14,0:39:02.71,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}想想Lily Belle。想想你妹妹。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just think of Lily Belle. Think of your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.74,0:39:04.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你不明白，Rachel。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}You don't understand, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.48,0:39:05.58,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}就，求你了，就……\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just, please, just...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.61,0:39:07.11,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}Mary，你现在绝不是一个人。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Mary, you are so not alone right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.14,0:39:08.41,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我陪着你，好吗？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}I am with you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.45,0:39:09.95,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}一切会好起来的，我保证。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}It's gonna get better, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.98,0:39:11.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}只要一天\N{\rEN\blur0.8}All it takes is one day
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.48,0:39:14.45,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}你对一切的感觉就会不一样。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}for you to feel differently about everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.49,0:39:16.05,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}现在把你的手给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just give me your hand right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.09,0:39:18.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}好吗，亲爱的？\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Okay, sweetie?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.59,0:39:20.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}把手给我。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just give me your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.63,0:39:25.13,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}跟我来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.16,0:39:26.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}不，Mary！等等。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}No, Mary! Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.91,0:39:45.78,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}我靠！Mary！快打911！\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Holy shit! Mary! Call 911!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.82,0:39:47.18,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.22,0:39:49.02,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}她在呼吸吗？醒醒，Mary。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Is she breathing? Come on, Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.05,0:39:50.59,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}快叫该死的急救人员来。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Just get the damn paramedics.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.50,0:39:57.86,ZH,,0,0,0,,{\rZH\blur0.8}哦。\N{\rEN\blur0.8}Oh.
